	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Fair-Rite BN61-2402 small binocular ferrite core (type 61 material, same body as BN43-2402: 7.52 x 7.52 x 5.08 mm per Fair-Rite 2861002402 datasheet; two 1.52 mm dia bores on 2.54 mm pitch). Mounted VERTICALLY (standing on end). Hand-wound, 5-pad layout for a transformer where one winding has a center tap and the other does not (used in Rev D for T3 - 3T CT primary + 2T secondary; and T4 - 2T primary + 3T CT secondary bifilar). Pad layout: pins 1 and 3 are the two ends of the CT winding (primary for T3, secondary for T4); pin 2 is the center tap; pins 4 and 5 are the two ends of the non-tapped winding. VERIFY body dimensions and winding arrangement against build intent before fab.")
